{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN OUR DISCORD:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/b125229d73f7b061cb120fc447f8ac4f.avif?t=1758649063\" width=622 height=276 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Triangle - Cursed Town</strong> is a 4-player online co-op atmospheric horror game. You and your friends are a team sent by the church. Together, you will enter the cursed village, try to collect as much evidence as possible, and complete the necessary ritual to lift the curse. The tools you find in the village will help you learn about the type of demon you're dealing with and uncover the mystery behind the curse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/dc3b1194ccf798059532899afb5c4998.poster.avif?t=1758649063\" width=700 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/dc3b1194ccf798059532899afb5c4998.webm?t=1758649063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/dc3b1194ccf798059532899afb5c4998.mp4?t=1758649063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Immersive Experience:\u00a0</strong>Get ready for an intense and chilling experience with gripping visuals, eerie atmospheric sounds, and a minimal interface that pulls you into the horror.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/8d4e304a3d6189e190dff91d25fd2370.poster.avif?t=1758649063\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/8d4e304a3d6189e190dff91d25fd2370.webm?t=1758649063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/8d4e304a3d6189e190dff91d25fd2370.mp4?t=1758649063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tools &amp; Equipments:\u00a0</strong>Use your equipment to interact with the demon, collect clues, and discover what kind of entity you're facing. Gather the required items, complete the ritual, and cleanse the village of evil.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/ea8f8a59a5530b3e6b0646fdcf275b22.poster.avif?t=1758649063\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/ea8f8a59a5530b3e6b0646fdcf275b22.webm?t=1758649063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/ea8f8a59a5530b3e6b0646fdcf275b22.mp4?t=1758649063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Cursed Town</strong>: Remember, this village is cursed by someone. Your duty is to restore the sanctity of this village and find out who caused this curse or not. Explore the village with your friends and solve its mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/0d59ecc76705ea90fb4641733821f71e.poster.avif?t=1758649063\" width=700 height=400 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/0d59ecc76705ea90fb4641733821f71e.webm?t=1758649063\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/0d59ecc76705ea90fb4641733821f71e.mp4?t=1758649063\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3266950?t=1758649063","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3266950?t=1758649063","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/38b52d3d3bad3ff6a3d962c60657c7e0d13e87b6/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758649063","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/38b52d3d3bad3ff6a3d962c60657c7e0d13e87b6/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758649063","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Adjustable Difficulty","id":78},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>JOIN OUR DISCORD:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3266950/extras/b125229d73f7b061cb120fc447f8ac4f.avif?t=1758649063\" width=622 height=276 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Triangle - Cursed Town</strong> is a 4-player online co-op atmospheric horror game. You and your friends are a team sent by the church. Together, you will enter the cursed village, try to collect 